            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Moroni 9:14",
        "book": "Moroni",
        "chapter": 9,
        "verse": 14
      },
      {
        "text": "Behold, my heart cries: Wo unto this people. Come out in judgment, O God, and hide their sins, and wickedness, and abominations from before thy face!",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 15,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Moroni 9:15",
        "book": "Moroni",
        "chapter": 9,
        "verse": 15
      },
      {
        "text": "And again, my son, there are many widows and their daughters who remain in Sherrizah; and that part of the provisions which the Lamanites did not carry away, behold, the army of Zenephi has carried away, and left them to wander whithersoever they can for food; and many old women do faint by the way and die.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 34,
            "end": 40,
            "text": "Mosiah 21:10 (10, 17). TG Widows."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 16,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Moroni 9:16",
        "book": "Moroni",
        "chapter": 9,
        "verse": 16
      },
      {
        "text": "And the army which is with me is weak; and the armies of the Lamanites are betwixt Sherrizah and me; and as many as have fled to the army of Aaron have fallen victims to their awful brutality.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 141,
            "end": 146,
            "text": "Morm. 2:9."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 17,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "Morm. 2:9.",
            "prettyString": "Mormon 2:9",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "mormon",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 2,
                    "end": 2,
                    "verses": [
                      {
