        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Moroni 9:18",
        "book": "Moroni",
        "chapter": 9,
        "verse": 18
      },
      {
        "text": "And they have become strong in their perversion; and they are alike brutal, sparing none, neither old nor young; and they delight in everything save that which is good; and the suffering of our women and our children upon all the face of this land doth exceed everything; yea, tongue cannot tell, neither can it be written.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 19,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Moroni 9:19",
        "book": "Moroni",
        "chapter": 9,
        "verse": 19
      },
      {
        "text": "And now, my son, I dwell no longer upon this horrible scene. Behold, thou knowest the wickedness of this people; thou knowest that they are without principle, and past feeling; and their wickedness doth exceed that of the Lamanites.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 203,
            "end": 209,
            "text": "Hel. 6:34 (18–35)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 20,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Moroni 9:20",
        "book": "Moroni",
        "chapter": 9,
        "verse": 20
      },
      {
        "text": "Behold, my son, I cannot recommend them unto God lest he should smite me.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 21,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Moroni 9:21",
        "book": "Moroni",
        "chapter": 9,
        "verse": 21
      },
      {
        "text": "But behold, my son, I recommend thee unto God, and I trust in Christ that thou wilt be saved; and I pray unto God that he will spare thy life, to witness the return of his people unto him, or their utter destruction; for I know that they must perish except they repent and return unto him.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 100,
            "end": 104,
            "text": "W of M 1:8."
          },
          {
            "start": 127,
            "end": 132,
